# Local git worktrees are checkouts, not repository content. Both locations:
# .worktrees/<branch> is the hand-made one, .claude/worktrees/<branch> is where
# Claude Code puts its own. The second was missing, so a scratch checkout showed
# up inside the project — an editor then reports its half-finished edits as
# changes to YOUR tree, which is alarming and completely untrue.
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/
